{"name":"Classic Terra","hex":"#e4ceae","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"classic","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of or relating to the first class or rank, especially in literature or art.","Exemplary of a particular style; defining a class or category; typical; archetypical; epitomic."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A perfect and/or early example of a particular style.","An artistic work of lasting worth, such as a film or song; a work of enduring excellence."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/classic"},{"term":"terra","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A geologic and geographic region of a celestial body which is a highland analogous to a continent or large landmass."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Earth, soil, land, or ground as a physical surface.","The material world as opposed to the heavens."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/terra"}],"entries":[{"title":"Terra (blockchain)","blocks":[{"text":"Terra is a blockchain protocol and payment platform used for algorithmic stablecoins. The project was created in 2018 by Terraform Labs, a startup co-founded by Do Kwon and Daniel Shin. It is best known for its Terra algorithmic stablecoin and the associated LUNA reserve asset cryptocurrency."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terra_(blockchain)","wikidata":"Q112056627"},{"title":"Classic","blocks":[{"text":"A classic is an outstanding example of a particular style; something of lasting worth or with a timeless quality; of the first or highest quality, class, or rank – something that exemplifies its class. The word can be an adjective or a noun. It denotes a particular quality in art, architecture, literature, design, technology, or other cultural artifacts. In commerce, products are named 'classic' to denote a long-standing popular version or model, to distinguish it from a newer variety. Classic is used to describe many major, long-standing sporting events. Colloquially, an everyday occurrence may be described in some dialects of English as 'an absolute classic'."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Classic","wikidata":"Q2976603"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Do_Kwon.png/500px-Do_Kwon.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Do_Kwon.png/500px-Do_Kwon.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Do-hyung Kwon, founder of Terraform Labs, creator of TerraUSD","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADo_Kwon.png"}],"sounds":{"classic":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-classic.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-classic.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-classic.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-classic.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-classic.wav.ogg"}],"terra":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-terra.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-terra.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-terra.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-terra.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-terra.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"God of Vegitation and springtime (xipe) or his priest wearing a flayed skin, Gulf Coast, South-central Veracruz, Early Clasic Period, c. 250-550 CE, terra cotta","image":"https://thumb.wiki